TICouncilorTypeTemplate.displayName.Cosmonaut = Cosmonaut
TICouncilorTypeTemplate.description.Cosmonaut = A Cosmonaut is a person trained to travel in a spacecraft. They are responsible for conducting experiments, operating spacecraft systems, and ensuring the safety of the crew during space missions.

